'''Steelgrill's Depot''' is small settlement of [[miner]]s and [[engineer]]s that lies just east of [[Kharanos]] in [[Dun Morogh]]. There are three [[trainer]]s, some [[vendor]]s, and a few low-level [[quest]]s available in the settlement.

